{"unit_id":"LittleBlackTong__dsh-plugin-heartbeat#feature-1","repo":"LittleBlackTong/dsh-plugin-heartbeat","commit":"a13557510607911c68e2759fb1b57ccf8430b895","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-heartbeat 的功能「变化触发提醒」：比较待办、团队任务、目标和未答问题的会话投影，只把检测到的变化交给后续门控；重复状态不会每次脉冲都转成提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/sensors.js:111-129"]}
